[100.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HReview: test scores are synthetic point injections.\r\nPrecision/recall are not failure-diagnosis accuracy.\r\nFeature evidence describes robust deviations, not causes.\r\nOpen docs/evaluation.md and docs/limitations.md for scope.\r\nRun python app/gradio_app.py for the interactive loopback demo."]
